<idea-plugin require-restart="true">
    <id>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv</id>
    <name>CSV Editor</name>
    <vendor url="https://github.com/SeeSharpSoft/intellij-csv-validator">
        Martin Sommer
    </vendor>
    <resource-bundle>localization.CsvEditorResources</resource-bundle>

    <description><![CDATA[
        <p><b>Edit CSV, TSV, and PSV files as text or as a table</b> &ndash; with rainbow column colors, syntax validation, formatting, quick fixes, and a spreadsheet-style table editor, right inside your JetBrains IDE.</p>
        <img width="600" height="297" src="https://plugins.jetbrains.com/files/10037/screenshot_80656a25-da46-4f76-b5c1-a9e8263b8bf3" />

        <h3>Major upgrade: a whole new table editor experience</h3>
        <p>Version <b>252.53</b> is a major upgrade of CSV Editor. The table editor has been redesigned and packed with the
        features you know from spreadsheets &ndash; while every change is still written straight to your CSV document and can be undone like any other edit.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Fresh, modern look</b> &ndash; padded cells, a flat header, and rounded scrollbars that follow the IDE's light or dark appearance, plus flicker-free rendering.</li>
            <li><b>Find &amp; Replace in tables</b> &ndash; search with the IDE's familiar shortcuts, including case-sensitive, whole-word, and regex matching; jump between matches and <em>Replace All</em> in one undoable step.</li>
            <li><b>Frozen columns</b> &ndash; keep ID or name columns in view while scrolling horizontally; the setting is remembered per file.</li>
            <li><b>Drag &amp; drop rows and columns</b> &ndash; reorder data by dragging column headers or row numbers, or use the new <em>Move</em> actions in the context menu.</li>
            <li><b>Spreadsheet-style copy &amp; paste</b> &ndash; copy cells as correctly quoted CSV or as an HTML table, and paste CSV or spreadsheet data at the focused cell; the table grows only when needed.</li>
            <li><b>One-click view switching</b> &ndash; toggle between text and table editor from the editor tab bar, and your selected field follows you between both views.</li>
            <li><b>Your shortcuts, your way</b> &ndash; assign or change every table editor shortcut in the IDE's Keymap settings; changes apply instantly to open editors.</li>
            <li><b>Smarter column highlighting</b> &ndash; switch active-column highlighting on or off and limit how many rows get highlighted.</li>
            <li><b>Refreshed icons</b> &ndash; new CSV, TSV, and PSV file icons and a consistent SVG icon set, crisp on HiDPI screens in light and dark themes.</li>
            <li><b>Built for current IDEs</b> &ndash; targets IntelliJ Platform 2025.2 and newer, with a new version scheme where <em>252.53.0</em> tells you the earliest supported IDE (2025.2) at a glance.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Everything you need for tabular data</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><b>Text and table editor</b> &ndash; choose which editor opens first, or use the text editor only.</li>
            <li><b>Rainbow column coloring</b> &ndash; spot columns instantly with 10 configurable column colors, or use plain text coloring instead.</li>
            <li><b>Syntax validation &amp; highlighting</b> &ndash; RFC 4180-based validation that tolerates common real-world variations.</li>
            <li><b>Quick fixes &amp; intentions</b> (Alt+Enter) &ndash; add missing quotes or separators, quote/unquote values or the whole file, and shift columns left or right.</li>
            <li><b>Formatting</b> &ndash; control spacing around separators, trim whitespace, or align values as a readable table.</li>
            <li><b>Flexible separators</b> &ndash; comma, semicolon, colon, pipe, tab, record separator, or your own; auto-detected and adjustable per file.</li>
            <li><b>Escape characters &amp; comments</b> &ndash; use <code>"</code> or <code>\</code> as escape character, and customizable line comments (<code>#</code> by default).</li>
            <li><b>Helpful extras</b> &ndash; an info tooltip with value, header, and column number, spell checking, and caret-row and tab-separator highlighting.</li>
            <li><b>Localized UI</b> &ndash; available in English and Simplified Chinese.</li>
        </ul>

        <p><b>TSV/PSV support:</b> TSV and PSV files are recognized as their own file types and get the same editors, highlighting, inspections, intentions, and code style settings as CSV files.</p>
        <p><b>IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate, PhpStorm, DataGrip, etc.:</b> CSV Editor works alongside the built-in <em>Edit as Table...</em> functionality.</p>
        <p><b>Using an older IDE?</b> Previous plugin versions remain available for <a href="https://github.com/SeeSharpSoft/intellij-csv-validator#installation">manual installation</a>.</p>
        <br>
        <p>Learn more in the <a href="https://github.com/SeeSharpSoft/intellij-csv-validator/blob/main/README.md">README</a>,
        see what's new in the <a href="https://github.com/SeeSharpSoft/intellij-csv-validator/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">changelog</a>,
        and share feedback or report issues on <a href="https://github.com/SeeSharpSoft/intellij-csv-validator/issues">GitHub</a>.</p>
        <br>
        <p><em>Thanks to @royqh1979, @egoisticalgoat, @sabi0, @ptahchiev, @ghost, @MarkJeronimus and others for supporting me and the project!</em></p>
    ]]></description>

    <!-- please see http://www.jetbrains.org/intellij/sdk/docs/basics/getting_started/plugin_compatibility.html on how to target different products -->
    <depends>com.intellij.modules.lang</depends>
    <depends optional="true" config-file="withSpellchecker.xml">com.intellij.modules.spellchecker</depends>
    <depends optional="true" config-file="withGithub.xml">org.jetbrains.plugins.github</depends>

    <extensions defaultExtensionNs="com.intellij">
        <fileType name="CSV" language="csv" implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvFileType" extensions="csv"/>
        <fileType name="TSV" language="csv" implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.tsv.TsvFileType" extensions="tsv;tab"/>
        <fileType name="PSV" language="csv" implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.psv.PsvFileType" extensions="psv"/>

        <lang.parserDefinition language="csv"
                               implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvParserDefinition"/>

        <lang.syntaxHighlighterFactory language="csv"
                                       implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.highlighter.CsvSyntaxHighlighterFactory"/>
        <editorHighlighterProvider filetype="CSV"
                                   implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.highlighter.CsvEditorHighlighterProvider"/>
        <editorHighlighterProvider filetype="TSV"
                                   implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.highlighter.CsvEditorHighlighterProvider"/>
        <editorHighlighterProvider filetype="PSV"
                                   implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.highlighter.CsvEditorHighlighterProvider"/>
        <colorSettingsPage implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvColorSettings"/>

        <additionalTextAttributes scheme="Default" file="misc/column_coloring_default.xml" />
        <additionalTextAttributes scheme="Darcula" file="misc/column_coloring_default_dark.xml" />

        <applicationService
                serviceImplementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvEditorSettings"/>
        <projectService serviceImplementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.components.CsvFileAttributes"/>

        <editorOptionsProvider instance="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvEditorSettingsProvider"/>
        <fileEditorProvider implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.editor.CsvFileEditorProvider"/>
        <fileEditorProvider implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.editor.table.CsvTableEditorProvider"/>

        <annotator language="csv" implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.editor.CsvAnnotator"/>

        <lang.formatter language="csv"
                        implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.formatter.CsvFormattingModelBuilder"/>
        <codeStyleSettingsProvider
                implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvCodeStyleSettingsProvider"/>
        <langCodeStyleSettingsProvider
                implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvLanguageCodeStyleSettingsProvider"/>

        <iconProvider implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvIconProvider"/>

        <localInspection
                language="csv"
                enabledByDefault="true"
                groupName="CSV"
                shortName="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.inspection.CsvValidationInspection"
                implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.inspection.CsvValidationInspection"/>
        <lang.inspectionSuppressor language="csv"
                                   implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.inspection.CsvInspectionSuppressor"/>

        <intentionAction id="CsvShiftColumnLeft" order="FIRST">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvShiftColumnLeftIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>ShiftColumnLeft</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>
        <intentionAction id="CsvShiftColumnRight" order="AFTER CsvShiftColumnLeft">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvShiftColumnRightIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>ShiftColumnRight</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>
        <intentionAction id="CsvQuoteValue" order="AFTER CsvShiftColumnRight">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvQuoteValueIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>QuoteValue</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>
        <intentionAction id="CsvUnquoteValue" order="AFTER CsvQuoteValue">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvUnquoteValueIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>UnquoteValue</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>
        <intentionAction id="CsvQuoteAll" order="BEFORE CsvUnquoteAll">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvQuoteAllIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>QuoteAll</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>
        <intentionAction id="CsvUnquoteAll" order="LAST">
            <className>net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.intention.CsvUnquoteAllIntentionAction</className>
            <category>CSV</category>
            <descriptionDirectoryName>UnquoteAll</descriptionDirectoryName>
        </intentionAction>

        <stripTrailingSpacesFilterFactory implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.settings.CsvStripTrailingSpacesFilterFactory" />

        <todoIndexer implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvTodoIndexer" filetype="CSV" />
        <todoIndexer implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvTodoIndexer" filetype="TSV" />
        <todoIndexer implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvTodoIndexer" filetype="PSV" />

        <postStartupActivity implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvPlugin" />

        <lang.commenter implementationClass="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.CsvCommenter" language="csv" />

        <!-- support for URL referencing -->
        <psi.referenceContributor language="csv" implementation="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.psi.CsvPsiReferenceContributor" />

        <notificationGroup displayType="STICKY_BALLOON" id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv" isLogByDefault="true" hideFromSettings="true" />
    </extensions>

    <projectListeners>
        <listener class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.editor.CsvEditorFieldSync"
                  topic="com.intellij.openapi.fileEditor.FileEditorManagerListener" />
    </projectListeners>

    <actions resource-bundle="localization.CsvEditorActions">
        <group id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu"
               popup="true"
        >
            <separator />
        </group>
        <group id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu"
               popup="true"
        >
            <separator />
        </group>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$FreezeColumns"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$FreezeColumns"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/freeze-columns.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$UnfreezeColumns"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$UnfreezeColumns"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/unfreeze-columns.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$FreezeColumns" anchor="after" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnBefore"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnBefore"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/add-column-before.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" anchor="first" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control shift LEFT" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnAfter"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnAfter"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/add-column-after.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnBefore" anchor="after" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control shift RIGHT" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedColumns"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedColumns"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/remove-column.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnAfter" anchor="after" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control shift DELETE" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control shift BACK_SPACE" />
        </action>

        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowBefore"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowBefore"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/add-row-before.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" anchor="first" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control UP" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowAfter"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowAfter"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/add-row-after.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowBefore" anchor="after" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control DOWN" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedRows"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedRows"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/remove-row.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowAfter" anchor="after" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control DELETE" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control BACK_SPACE" />
        </action>

        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ClearSelectedCells"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ClearSelectedCells">
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="DELETE" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="BACK_SPACE" />
        </action>

        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AdjustColumnWidths"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AdjustColumnWidths"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/adjust-column-width.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" />
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" />
            <keyboard-shortcut keymap="$default" first-keystroke="control shift SPACE" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsUp"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsUp"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/move-row-up.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedRows" anchor="after" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsDown"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsDown"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/move-row-down.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsUp" anchor="after" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsLeft"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsLeft"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/move-column-left.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedColumns" anchor="after" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsRight"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsRight"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/move-column-right.svg">
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsLeft" anchor="after" />
        </action>
        <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ResetColumnWidths"
                id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ResetColumnWidths"
                icon="/media/icons/actions/reset-column-width.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AdjustColumnWidths" anchor="after" />
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" relative-to-action="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AdjustColumnWidths" anchor="after" />
        </action>

        <group id="CsvTableEditorActions" popup="true">
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnBefore" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddColumnAfter" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedColumns" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowBefore" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AddRowAfter" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$DeleteSelectedRows" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ClearSelectedCells" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$AdjustColumnWidths" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$ResetColumnWidths" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsUp" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveRowsDown" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsLeft" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$MoveColumnsRight" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$FreezeColumns" />
            <reference ref="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvTableEditorActions$UnfreezeColumns" />
        </group>

        <group id="CsvEditorViewActions">
            <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvEditorViewActions$ShowTextEditor"
                    id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvEditorViewActions$ShowTextEditor"
                    icon="/media/icons/actions/show-text-editor.svg" />
            <action class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvEditorViewActions$ShowTableEditor"
                    id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvEditorViewActions$ShowTableEditor"
                    icon="/media/icons/actions/show-table-editor.svg" />
        </group>

        <group id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvChangeSeparatorActionGroup"
               class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvChangeSeparatorActionGroup"
               popup="true"
               icon="/media/icons/actions/change-separator.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="EditorPopupMenu" anchor="last"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" anchor="last"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" anchor="last"/>
        </group>

        <group id="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvChangeEscapeCharacterActionGroup"
               class="net.seesharpsoft.intellij.plugins.csv.actions.CsvChangeEscapeCharacterActionGroup"
               popup="true"
               icon="/media/icons/actions/change-escape-character.svg"
        >
            <add-to-group group-id="EditorPopupMenu" anchor="last"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorColumnContextMenu" anchor="last"/>
            <add-to-group group-id="CsvTableEditorRowContextMenu" anchor="last"/>
        </group>

    </actions>

</idea-plugin>
